频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FrS8OekSU_y6Lsjx-6UvLvA\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rS8OekSU_y6Lsjx-6UvLvA</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF139.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><font color=\"green\"><b>果断勇敢，出手敏捷</b></font><br />\n这是薇尔德族人对族长莉莉薇儿的<font color=\"green\"><b>一致评价</b></font><br />\n作为<font color=\"green\"><b>强大的战士</b></font><br />\n她背负着守护薇尔塔山的<font color=\"green\"><b>弓箭</b></font><br />\n也背负着整个薇尔德部族<font color=\"green\"><b>发展的希望</b></font>\n<br /><br />\n<font color=\"green\"><b>薇尔德人珍视每一份承诺</b></font><br />\n<font color=\"green\"><b>也无法……原谅背弃</b></font>\n</p>\n<br /></center>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">中文CV：秦紫翼</strong></p></div>\n